{"id":"msg_m_ex_isabel_03","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_isabel","label":"Isabel · Nikke"},"label":"3. Commander's Room","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_isabel_02","next":null,"speakers":{"isabel":"Isabel"},"icons":{"isabel":"si_c231_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_1","text":"Commander's Room","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_2","text":"doesn't have a password?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_3","text":"Why would I need that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_4","text":"For one,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_5","text":"it's practically a revolving door for all the Nikkes coming in and out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_6","text":"Don't you think that's a security risk?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_7","text":"They're here for work reasons, that's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_8","text":"I wouldn't be so sure of that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_9","text":"if I were you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_10","text":"Last time, I saw a Nikke enter","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_11","text":"and went straight for the bathroom.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_12","text":"How do you explain that?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_13","text":"The water in the dorm bathrooms often runs out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_14","text":"That's fair enough,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_15","text":"but I don't understand why they are taking a shower in your private bathroom?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_16","text":"I offered to let them use it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_17","text":"Wow!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_18","text":"You're so considerate!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_19","text":"You know, a little bit of selfishness","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_20","text":"isn't necessarily a bad thing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_21","text":"Is it only because of the water shortage?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_22","text":"Yes, it is.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_23","text":"Gotcha.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_24","text":"I thought they might have been harboring some ill intentions.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_25","text":"If so, I was gonna give 'em a working over!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_26","text":"But since you gave them the green light, I'll spare them this time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_27","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_27","text":"Thanks for understanding.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_28","text":"No problem!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_29","text":"I think I should get running water back to the dorm bathrooms.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_30","text":"Are you sure?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_31","text":"Positive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_32","text":"You may be okay with it,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_33","text":"but I can't stand","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_34","text":"the idea of other Nikkes showering in your quarters.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_isabel_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_isabel_03_35","text":"Have a good rest.","jump":null}],"chat":true}